{"id":"vod_sn_37573","vodId":"37573","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"普通攻击是全体攻击而且能二次攻击的妈妈你喜欢吗？","name_cn":"普通攻击是全体攻击而且能二次攻击的妈妈你喜欢吗？","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/91e6a5b3495a200d8a1751e30078b7b0.jpg"},"summary":"大好真人（石谷春贵 配音）是一位非常平凡的男子高中生，和大部分的同龄男生一样，真人对游戏和那些勇者斗恶龙的古老传说有着很大的兴趣。唯一令真人感到困扰的是，他拥有一位对他过度保护和过度关心的母亲真真子（茅野爱衣 配音），虽然明白母亲是因为非常的爱自己才会如此表现，但母亲的爱常常令真人感到喘不过气来。　　一场意外中，真人发现自己竟然被传送到了游戏世界之中，本以为终于能够摆脱真真子的束缚的真人万万没有想到的是，为了追随儿子的脚步，真真子竟然也紧随其后来到了游戏之中。不仅如此，真真子在游戏里还大受欢迎，人气非常之高。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mcSfUtjud91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uK8jkhPSWb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VFrwQVbmUW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M5H6THhHbj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nXAEzrrYeP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BdFgWP7CGA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nXBnzYVJbQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AezgLchfND1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rVCttisvgh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tdf0LNHRSB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5DuhmegMhK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HKaiztFuZB1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:09.252Z"}